#. じゃあさ、一緒にお話でもしよっか…？
msgctxt "0001 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "You want to sit down and talk for a while?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不二咲さんと一緒に、
#. お話をして過ごした…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I spent some time talking with Chihiro...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. え、苗木君と２人で…？
msgctxt "0003 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Huh? You mean...just the two of us?"
msgstr ""

#. うん、いいよ…
#. なんだか…ちょっと恥ずかしいけど…
msgctxt "0004 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, okay. I'm a little nervous, though..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>恥ずかしがってる不二咲さんと
#. 一緒に過ごした…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I spent some time with Chihiro, even though she seemed\n"
"kind of embarrassed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、一緒に休憩でもする？
#. 苗木君が良ければ…だけど…
msgctxt "0006 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Would you like to go somewhere and hang out? I\n"
"mean...if you don't mind..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不二咲さんと一緒に休憩した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I hung out with Chihiro for a while...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えへへ！　やった！
#. 苗木君とお話するの好きなんだ！
msgctxt "0008 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Eheh...yay! I really like talking to you."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不二咲さんと一緒に、
#. お話をして過ごした…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I spent some time talking with Chihiro...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不二咲さんと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Chihiro and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Chihiro a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
